{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團防彈少年團（BTS）將於今晚、周六及周日在台灣高雄世運主場館舉行3場演唱會，7子已於昨日下午抵台，其中成員Jin、J-Hope、V與Jungkook於傍晚現身六合夜市品嘗地道美食，吸引大批粉絲圍觀，導致附近一帶水洩不通。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.862683+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:14:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.540889+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.540889+00:00","content_hash":"154b5c17ce26d0a0367403df096229be58696c2fbcde5b9761ad90c1c8d84bc5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}